33	Discriminability does not translate to filtering utility: on arXiv ($\Kempirical{=}3$), graduated filtering still fails (Section~\ref{sec:filtering}), suggesting that $\Kempirical$ measures a detection boundary rather than a curation boundary.
34	
35	\paragraph{Scale trends ($\leq$32B).}
